# .cursorrules — PII PKP
# Governed by Baneeishaque/AI-Agent-Rules and Leonxlnx/taste-skill anti-slop guidelines

# Technical Standards
- Framework: Next.js 14 App Router (React 18, TypeScript 5, Tailwind CSS 3)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS with crisp engineering palettes, hairline blueprint grids, and strict WCAG AA contrast (>= 4.5:1).
- Images: All Next.js <Image> components must have explicit dimensions or aspect ratio styles to avoid DevTools CLS warnings.
- Mandatory: Zero console errors, zero console warnings, zero DevTools layout shift issues.
- Preserve: /logo-pii-black.png is the official chartered institute logo and must remain untouched.

# Anti-Slop Directive
- Never produce generic three-card feature rows with purple glow gradients.
- Build rich, stateful, interactive widgets (e.g. competency calculators, blueprint selectors, filterable agenda grids).
- Always verify with `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npm run build` before claiming completion.
